{"id":"36","title":"At the Supermarket","goal":"Find or request a grocery item, answer checkout questions, and explain a simple scanning or product problem.","language":"en","study":[{"id":"36-study-0","title":"Start here","blocks":[{"id":"ch36-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Where can I find...?","emphasis":true},{"text":" asks for an item's location. "},{"text":"Do you carry...?","emphasis":true},{"text":" asks whether the store sells it. "},{"text":"Do you have any more...?","emphasis":true},{"text":" asks about additional stock. You can begin with "},{"text":"Excuse me","emphasis":true},{"text":" when approaching a staff member."}],"span":[6,6],"phraseIds":["ch36-p163357514759895","ch36-p29125858618093","ch36-p8779744796703","ch36-p170044403036213"]},{"id":"ch36-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Useful department words are "},{"text":"produce","emphasis":true},{"text":" for fruit and vegetables, "},{"text":"dairy","emphasis":true},{"text":" for foods such as milk and cheese, "},{"text":"frozen foods","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"bakery","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"deli","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"household supplies","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"pet food","emphasis":true},{"text":". An "},{"text":"aisle","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a passage between shelves; "},{"text":"checkout","emphasis":true},{"text":" is where you pay."}],"span":[8,8],"phraseIds":["ch36-p100994481434901","ch36-p151068339732205","ch36-p76473541764808","ch36-p160176798852335","ch36-p97153410547500","ch36-p169125781073041","ch36-p242882144297487","ch36-p179138927792355","ch36-p270081253501175"]}],"line":6,"ja":"","theme":"supermarket"},{"id":"36-study-1","title":"Locating and requesting items","blocks":[{"id":"ch36-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"For practice, this fictional store has produce near the entrance, dairy in aisle 2, cereal in aisle 4, and pet food in aisle 7."}],"span":[12,12],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ch36-b3","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Excuse me, where can I find oat milk?"}],"id":"ch36-line14","person":"Customer","en":"Excuse me, where can I find oat milk?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Aisle two, with the other milk."}],"id":"ch36-line15","person":"Employee","en":"Aisle two, with the other milk.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Thanks. Do you have any more of this yogurt?"}],"id":"ch36-line16","person":"Customer","en":"Thanks. Do you have any more of this yogurt?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Let me check. Which flavor?"}],"id":"ch36-line17","person":"Employee","en":"Let me check. Which flavor?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Plain, please. The small containers."}],"id":"ch36-line18","person":"Customer","en":"Plain, please. The small containers.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"We have a few in the back. I'll bring them out."}],"id":"ch36-line19","person":"Employee","en":"We have a few in the back. I'll bring them out.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"}],"span":[14,19],"art":"ch36-scene-0.svg","theme":"supermarket","people":["Customer","Employee"],"caption":"Locating and requesting items · Customer & Employee","phraseIds":["ch36-line14","ch36-line15","ch36-line16","ch36-line17","ch36-line18","ch36-line19"]},{"id":"ch36-b4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Which flavor?","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"What size?","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"How many?","emphasis":true},{"text":" ask for details. Supply the detail rather than repeating only the original request: "},{"text":"Vanilla","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"The large container","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"Two, please","emphasis":true},{"text":"."}],"span":[21,21],"phraseIds":["ch36-p18369001014414","ch36-p118788685017130","ch36-p197236295897140","ch36-p212041920797860","ch36-p66254688000657","ch36-p162367375537591"]}],"line":10,"ja":"","theme":"supermarket"},{"id":"36-study-2","title":"At checkout","blocks":[{"id":"ch36-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"The next scene assumes a fictional total of $18.40 and a store that offers paper bags."}],"span":[25,25],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ch36-b6","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Cashier","runs":[{"text":"Did you find everything?"}],"id":"ch36-line27","person":"Cashier","en":"Did you find everything?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1534409916.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Almost. I couldn't find the cereal."}],"id":"ch36-line28","person":"Customer","en":"Almost. I couldn't find the cereal.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Cashier","runs":[{"text":"It's in aisle four. Would you like to get it?"}],"id":"ch36-line29","person":"Cashier","en":"It's in aisle four. Would you like to get it?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1534409916.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"No, that's okay. I'll get it another time."}],"id":"ch36-line30","person":"Customer","en":"No, that's okay. I'll get it another time.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Cashier","runs":[{"text":"Do you need a bag?"}],"id":"ch36-line31","person":"Cashier","en":"Do you need a bag?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1534409916.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"No, thanks. I brought my own."}],"id":"ch36-line32","person":"Customer","en":"No, thanks. I brought my own.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Cashier","runs":[{"text":"Your total is eighteen forty."}],"id":"ch36-line33","person":"Cashier","en":"Your total is eighteen forty.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1534409916.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Can I pay cash?"}],"id":"ch36-line34","person":"Customer","en":"Can I pay cash?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Cashier","runs":[{"text":"Yes. Would you like the receipt?"}],"id":"ch36-line35","person":"Cashier","en":"Yes. Would you like the receipt?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1534409916.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Yes, please."}],"id":"ch36-line36","person":"Customer","en":"Yes, please.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"}],"span":[27,36],"art":"ch36-scene-1.svg","theme":"supermarket","people":["Cashier","Customer"],"caption":"At checkout · Cashier & Customer","phraseIds":["ch36-line27","ch36-line28","ch36-line29","ch36-line30","ch36-line31","ch36-line32","ch36-line33","ch36-line34","ch36-line35","ch36-line36"]},{"id":"ch36-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Other useful replies include "},{"text":"Yes, everything, thanks","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"One bag, please","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"I have a rewards card. Can you scan it?","emphasis":true},{"text":" Do not assume every store has the same rewards program, accepted payments or bag policy; ask about the one you are using."}],"span":[38,38],"phraseIds":["ch36-p193019490511806","ch36-p83352484482836","ch36-p9580442176787"]}],"line":23,"ja":"","theme":"supermarket"},{"id":"36-study-3","title":"Asking for help","blocks":[{"id":"ch36-b8","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"This item won't scan","emphasis":true},{"text":" describes a scanning problem. "},{"text":"This carton is leaking","emphasis":true},{"text":" describes a product problem. "},{"text":"The price on the shelf was different","emphasis":true},{"text":" reports a price mismatch without claiming you know why."}],"span":[42,42],"phraseIds":["ch36-p150177166909452","ch36-p65679364265572","ch36-p211816549041937"]},{"id":"ch36-b9","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Excuse me, this item won't scan."}],"id":"ch36-line44","person":"Customer","en":"Excuse me, this item won't scan.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"I'll check it for you."}],"id":"ch36-line45","person":"Employee","en":"I'll check it for you.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Thanks. The shelf label said three dollars, too."}],"id":"ch36-line46","person":"Customer","en":"Thanks. The shelf label said three dollars, too.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Let me verify the price."}],"id":"ch36-line47","person":"Employee","en":"Let me verify the price.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"}],"span":[44,47],"art":"ch36-scene-2.svg","theme":"supermarket","people":["Customer","Employee"],"caption":"Asking for help · Customer & Employee","phraseIds":["ch36-line44","ch36-line45","ch36-line46","ch36-line47"]},{"id":"ch36-b10","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"You can request attention more firmly when needed: "},{"text":"I need help with this checkout, please.","emphasis":true},{"text":" Technical steps depend on the machine; describing the problem is enough for this language task."}],"span":[49,49],"phraseIds":["ch36-p273741644140361"]}],"line":40,"ja":"","theme":"supermarket"},{"id":"36-words","title":"Words & phrases","blocks":[{"id":"36-glossary","type":"vocabulary","phraseIds":["ch36-v0","ch36-v1","ch36-v2","ch36-v3"]}]}],"practice":[{"id":"36-practice-0","title":"Take your turn","blocks":[{"id":"ch36-b11","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Read staff lines aloud and supply customer turns. Alone, rehearse both roles."}],"span":[53,53]},{"id":"ch36-b12","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"number":1,"runs":[{"text":"Use the store directory to ask for cereal and pet food. The employee gives their aisle numbers. Confirm one number with "},{"text":"Aisle four?","emphasis":true},{"text":" or "},{"text":"Did you say seven?","emphasis":true}],"id":"ch36-b12-0"},{"number":2,"runs":[{"text":"At checkout, you found everything, brought a bag and want a receipt. Answer the three corresponding questions from the model."}],"id":"ch36-b12-1"},{"number":3,"runs":[{"text":"Your milk carton is leaking. Ask for help. The employee says "},{"text":"I can get another one.","emphasis":true},{"text":" Accept or say you no longer want milk."}],"id":"ch36-b12-2"}],"span":[55,57]}],"line":53,"ja":"","theme":"supermarket","answers":[{"id":"ch36-b13","type":"answer","runs":[{"text":"Sample possibilities:","emphasis":true},{"text":" “Where's the cereal?” — “Aisle four.” — “Aisle four? Thanks.” / “Yes, everything, thanks. I brought my own bag. Yes, a receipt, please.” / “This carton is leaking. Could you help me?” — “I can get another one.” — “Yes, please.”"}],"span":[59,59]},{"id":"ch36-b14","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Later, change the item and checkout preferences. Check that your request included the detail the staff member needed."}],"span":[61,61]}]}],"phrases":[{"id":"ch36-p163357514759895","en":"Where can I find...?","section":"36-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"phrase","studyId":"ch36-p163357514759895"},{"id":"ch36-p29125858618093","en":"Do you carry...?","section":"36-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"phrase","studyId":"ch36-p29125858618093"},{"id":"ch36-p8779744796703","en":"Do you have any more...?","section":"36-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"phrase","studyId":"ch36-p8779744796703"},{"id":"ch36-p170044403036213","en":"Excuse me","section":"36-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch36-p170044403036213"},{"id":"ch36-p100994481434901","en":"produce","section":"36-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch36-p100994481434901"},{"id":"ch36-p151068339732205","en":"dairy","section":"36-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch36-p151068339732205"},{"id":"ch36-p76473541764808","en":"frozen foods","section":"36-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch36-p76473541764808"},{"id":"ch36-p160176798852335","en":"bakery","section":"36-